1	Query_1[-1]	Specific	469362	3144	3242	3.7529e-05	42.3935	NF041474	membrane_YkgR	-	-
1	Query_1[-2]	Specific	197715	776	901	2.62562e-09	54.8406	smart00421	HTH_LUXR	C	481199
1	Query_1[-2]	Specific	442052	776	1273	5.67389e-09	57.8434	COG2771	CsgD	-	-
1	Query_1[-3]	Specific	503166	2392	2514	2.28885e-14	68.4852	NF002021	PRK00831	-	-
